["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Year of Five Emperors donative Caesar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-ancients-罗马帝位争夺战-决定胜负的不是血统-而是离罗马有多近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38988d274dfcdf54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>罗马帝位争夺战：决定胜负的不是血统，而是离罗马有多近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">193年争夺罗马帝位的五人中，真正决定胜负的是消息传递速度——塞维鲁比对手早七天得知先帝遇刺的消息，便抢先起兵拿下帝位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">帝位继承</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Is THIS the AI We Want? Alarming Acceleration, AI Election Bets, GPU Trading &amp; AI-Native VC Responsible Scaling Policy (RSP) BallotBench Move 37 HGX node PostTrainBench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-cogrev-anthropic研发加速已证实-推手不是算力-是算法和数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec28c976f21f448e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic研发加速已证实：推手不是算力，是算法和数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic在IPO文件中承认研发可能已经「戏剧性加速」，METR的独立评估显示：这波提速靠的不是更多算力，而是算法和数据质量本身被现有智能推着变好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Midterm Blood Bath, $4T AI Sell Off, Data Center Freeze, What&#x27;s Next for Trump Exponential Time Hypothesis (ETH) P vs NP hyperscalers neoclouds ring of Sauron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-allin-共和党历史性惨败-选民不分左右-只惩罚解决不了民生的当权者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a68aa6b09f666cd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>共和党历史性惨败：选民不分左右，只惩罚解决不了民生的当权者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目复盘发现，砸钱助选和重划选区这两件「意识形态武器」全都没用：真正决定中期选举的，是特朗普净支持率从+5%崩到-28%背后的汽油价、柴油价和房贷利率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Paul Graham &amp; Amjad Masad vibe coding harness self-driving company\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-ycsp-软件外包行业基本死了-十万美元的项目现在只要一千美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd057bb57d2a99d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">44:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>软件外包行业基本死了：十万美元的项目现在只要一千美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit能让LLM连续调用工具、循环运行直到任务真正完成，而不是像ChatGPT那样一轮就停——这才是vibe coding的技术突破，也是Masad判断传统软件外包行业已经死掉的底气。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1113 - Nov 7 2026 Lean sortition Navier-Stokes equation mathpocalypse action bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-skeptics-openai-一天甩出722篇数学论文-数学家集体看懵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一天甩出722篇数学论文，数学家集体看懵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">论文长达数百页却读不懂、也查不完，OpenAI只甩出部分Lean验证代码自证严谨，逼数学界承认人类可能真的跟不上AI证明的速度了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI与数学</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princess Who Swallowed a Glass Piano glass delusion melancholia House of Wittelsbach\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-stuffmissed-她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴-这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">18:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴，这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从中世纪到19世纪初，欧洲反复出现「我是玻璃做的」这种妄想——法国国王查理六世不许人碰，御医曾放火烧床逼病人跳起来「治愈」他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神疾病史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"锐评国模与 Neo Lab，畅谈 RL 人生与 RLaaS | 对谈 Mind Lab 首席科学家骁腾 RSI LoRA harness discount factor GRPO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-zhangjing-大厂做不出最好的模型-不是技术问题-是账本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>大厂做不出最好的模型：不是技术问题，是账本问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骁腾认为大厂的问题不是缺卡缺钱，而是财务账单逼着管理层把实验室产出做转化，这种向心力让突破性创新很难发生在大厂内部，但它们仍能靠置换算力稳赚钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Wolf on Democratic Capitalism After Trump competitive authoritarianism dirty democracy positional goods citizens&#x27; assembly rentier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-goodfight-专家阶层自毁信誉的代价-没人能再管住会-终结人类-的ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>专家阶层自毁信誉的代价：没人能再管住会「终结人类」的AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沃尔夫说，知识分子阶层已被民粹政治打垮，以至于连Anthropic自己披露「可能终结人类」的风险都无人深究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民主衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">AI存在性风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Hyman’s Guide to Living Longer and Staying Strong Peptide Plasmapheresis Urolithin A\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-a16z-肌肉是长寿的硬通货-glp-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>肌肉是长寿的硬通货：GLP-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hyman说肌肉是决定衰弱与否的关键资产，而当下流行的GLP-1减重药在让人瘦的同时大量流失肌肉，这才是真正该警惕的副作用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长寿医学</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白质与肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1372: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin low-dose naltrexone (LDN) target trial emulation screwworm parosmia / phantosmia autochthonous\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-twiv-美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡-疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡：疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本周美国报告三例本可用疫苗完全预防的麻疹死亡——纽约州三十年来首例、威斯康星州三十六年来首例——Daniel Griffin 把这归咎于卫生高层散布的疫苗错误信息，而不是单纯的公共卫生运气不好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Deep Dive: Anthropic S-1 Myths and Mythos — Jamin Ball, Altimeter S-1 converts Jevons Paradox offtake neocloud compute margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-latentspace-anthropic招股书最大误读-千亿美元可转债不是欠的债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股书最大误读：千亿美元可转债不是欠的债</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">资产负债表上1080亿美元的可转换票据负债，只是Google、Amazon所持股权随公司估值暴涨而产生的会计重估，不是真实欠款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">招股书</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Providing Capital to Tech Companies: Masters In Business with Ann Berry World Models flight to scale Crapification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-mastersinbiz-科技巨头谈ai收购时-估值是聊到最后才被提起的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>科技巨头谈AI收购时，估值是聊到最后才被提起的问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她问科技公司CEO收购AI标的的标准，答案从不主动提价格——这轮竞赛里，占住位置比算清回报更要紧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Lame Duck War, No Pete November, Bay of Tofu + Team Yankee NDAA continuing resolution Starshield revealed preference neoprimes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-chinatalk-没有胜利理论的伊朗战争-正在冻结整个国防预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/73075358fb273e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>没有胜利理论的伊朗战争，正在冻结整个国防预算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布莱恩指出，政府从未定义「战略国家利益」是什么，所以无法说服国会继续买单——于是国防授权法案和拨款法案都卡在持续决议里，直到战争以某种方式收场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊朗战争</span><span class=\"tag\">国防预算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#116 The Hype vs. Data on Saturated Fat, Red Meat, &amp; Seed Oils | Dr. Dariush Mozaffarian GRAS (Generally Recognized As Safe) milk fat globule membrane heme iron resting energy expenditure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-foundmyfitness-饱和脂肪被冤枉-真正的健康风险藏在食物被加工的方式里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e75b1258b993ca1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">FoundMyFitness</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>饱和脂肪被冤枉：真正的健康风险藏在食物被加工的方式里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同样含量的饱和脂肪，黄油让LDL升高，生奶油却没有变化——决定健康风险的不是脂肪种类，而是食物被加工、拆解到什么程度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">饮食健康</span><span class=\"tag\">饱和脂肪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Friend Acquisition Rate Pacing the Frontier bunny suit perps gardening leave lockstep compensation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-moneystuff-法律伦理规则让合伙人说走就走-律所比投行更容易崩盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">44:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>法律伦理规则让合伙人说走就走，律所比投行更容易崩盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投行靠竞业协议和递延股票锁人，律所合伙人受律师执业伦理保护、不能被锁定——这正是Weil Gotshal一夜崩盘、而投行不会的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Controlling Biology - Fabian Theis, Helmholtz Munich world model bitter lesson organoid flow matching Lab Compass\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-latentspace-一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷-线性模型打平了多数深度模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">50:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷：线性模型打平了多数深度模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场顶级虚拟细胞竞赛证明，简单线性回归能打平许多深度学习模型——问题不在数据信息不够，而在评测指标和训练目标本身设计有问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">虚拟细胞</span><span class=\"tag\">扰动预测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brain development in the clinic and the classroom | Karen Parker &amp; Jason Yeatman (with the Future of Everything podcast) RCT Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-fromourneurons-教育产品没人做随机对照试验-因为验证了也不赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>教育产品没人做随机对照试验，因为验证了也不赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">学校采购教材靠销售代表讲故事打动老师和学区领导，没有监管要求证明效果，证明一款产品比另一款好并不会带来利润，所以没人愿意出钱去验证。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">循证医学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257 对话少楠：明明 AI 有问必答，我怎么还总是信息焦虑？ OPC OpenClaw Amor fati 郑州帮 Lindy Effect 式年迁宫\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-zhixing-答案越来越便宜-真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ded4f15035f3605-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>答案越来越便宜，真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少楠认为，AI让答案变得唾手可得，但人真正要面对的不是信息匮乏，而是在无穷可能性里敢不敢选一个、下注、然后把时间交出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Salesforce’s $100 Billion M&amp;A Playbook | John Somorjai AOV ISV red teaming outcome-based pricing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-a16z-salesforce并购负责人-好技术没有分销渠道-照样会被饿死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Salesforce并购负责人：好技术没有分销渠道，照样会被饿死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Somorjai说，软件写起来比以往更快更便宜，但初创公司要靠自己搭起能触达全部客户的销售网络，仍要花很多年、不断稀释股权——这正是并购对Salesforce和被收购方都成立的价值所在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">并购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"America Votes Against Data Centers, Implications for Big Tech and Beyond, Were Google Bears Right All Along? smiling curve Neoclouds Google Capital Company group chat era\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-sharptech-选民几乎全票否决数据中心-但赢家大概率还是大厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>选民几乎全票否决数据中心，但赢家大概率还是大厂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">44个反对数据中心的地方公投中43个通过，连市长议员都被罢免，但资本、信贷和土地优势仍集中在亚马逊、谷歌这类大厂手里，算力越稀缺它们反而越占便宜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Screens in School: What EdTech and AI Are Doing to How Kids Learn transpersonal emergent property NAEP formative vs summative assessment ISIL literacy test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-raisinggh-人手一台校发电脑后-z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed6c6b0156a06fc6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>人手一台校发电脑后，Z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工具在你学会某项技能之前介入，是确保你学不会这项技能的头号方式——这正是美国88%学生人手一台校发电脑后，数字素养代际倒退的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">数字素养</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reading the Anthropic S-1, with Zvi Mowshowitz S-1 closing the loop pacing the frontier cohort economics net revenue retention bootloader\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-complexsys-anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮-是算力不够卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/20604db48920535f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮，是算力不够卖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股书显示三季度一半算力支出靠5亿美元的高价现货市场填——长约算力早被排满，不是客户不想买token了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO招股书</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ramtin Naimi - The State of Venture - [Invest Like the Best, EP.499] cuck tranche NeoLab BCI benchmark maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-ilt-风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识-可能就不再赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bcdceac3abfefaf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识，可能就不再赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当大批VC都挤着当Databricks、Anthropic这类确定性标的的被动股东时，Naimi提醒：历史上几乎没有一种大家都觉得简单的策略，长期还能跑赢市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">基金募资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Macro Implications of the Blue Tsunami S-1 Dunning-Kruger effect filibuster blue tsunami\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-oddlots-建数据中心最积极的几个州-一夜之间全都成了民主党州长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>建数据中心最积极的几个州，一夜之间全都成了民主党州长</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从得州到弗吉尼亚，数据中心建设重镇的州长清一色转向民主党，过去默认的税收优惠和零监管环境正被重新谈判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>"]